Description:
PyroCCS is a vertically integrated industrial biochar and pyrolysis platform — the Biomass Value Platform turning excess biomass into high-volume biochar, bioproducts, and permanent carbon removal.

We offer affordable decentralized pyrolysis solutions for harsh environments. Feedstocks span agricultural and processing wastes, forestry and wildfire excess, invasive and encroaching species, and crop residues — biomass that would otherwise burn or rot.

Our product platform:
// Solid Carbon — Biochar for Soil, Metallurgical Biocarbon, Activated Carbon
// Liquids — Reformed Bio-Oil (deoxygenated, thermally stable)
// Energy — Industrial Heat, Power, Enhanced Syngas
// Carbon Removal — durable CDR credits with full MRV traceability

At the core is our Gravity Series of pyrolysis reactors — cost-effective, modular, and robust across contexts. The Gravity C (continuous flow) and Gravity SCB (semi-continuous batch) systems are paired with Sarva OS and MRV+, our proprietary operating and digital MRV stack endorsed by leading carbon registries.

For biomass owners we provide an end-to-end solution: turnkey plants, integrated software, O&M support, and established offtake into industrial product and carbon credit markets. We succeed when our partners do.

Operations and partnerships span Africa, Europe, South and Southeast Asia, and the Americas. Our flagship PyroNam project is restoring Namibian land overrun by 1B+ tonnes of encroaching bush — generating biochar, carbon credits, and rural employment at scale.

We're looking for:
// Biomass Owners looking for technology solutions to valorise their biomass
// Industrial offtake for biocarbon, activated carbon, and bio-oil
// Offtake contracts for carbon removal credits
// Project finance
// Partnerships
